# LaTeX project conventions

- Ten documents, one folder each (`M1-math-foundations/` ... `GR-general-relativity/`), plus the reference
  document `GLOSSARY/` and the holder `unsorted/UNSORTED.tex`. Each has `main.tex` (or `UNSORTED.tex`) and
  `latexmkrc`; output is `build/<CODE>.pdf`. Build everything with `tools/build_all.ps1`.
- Document folder layout: `chapters/chNN-slug/` (`00-section.tex` = heading + intro + `\input` list),
  `chapters/00-part-*.tex` (part heading + intro), `exercises/chNN-slug.tex`, `figures/`, `sources/`.
  Chapter order and prerequisites are in `main.tex`, generated by `tools/restructure.py scaffold`
  from `tools/structure_config.py`; the syllabus lives in `/CHAPTER_ORGANIZATION.md`.
- `\input` paths are relative to the document folder. Preamble is shared: `shared/preamble/`.
  Macros, environments, colours and packages live ONLY there. No `\newcommand` in content files.
- Every content file starts with
  `% Section N: title | Part: P | Depends on: ... | Status: todo|done`
  followed by `%!TEX root = <relative path>/main.tex`.
- Move-only policy: never write, rewrite, summarise or delete content. Moves go through
  `tools/migration_map.csv` and are recorded in `/MIGRATION_LEDGER.md`. Missing material is a
  `\missingchapter{DOC/chNN}{title}{prereqs}` entry (TODO box), never invented text.
- One owner per topic: other documents use `\ref` to it. Labels are unique across all documents; references
  across documents resolve through `xr-hyper` and print the target document (`M2:3.2`). Keep existing
  label names. Prefixes: `part:`, `sec:`, `def:`, `thm:`, `prop:`, `lem:`, `cor:`, `ex:`, `rem:`, `eq:`,
  `fig:`, `tab:`, `id:` (glossary identities). Never hard-code numbers.
- Symbols, terms, identities and the bibliography belong to `GLOSSARY/` only.
- Sources go to the owning document's `sources/` folder and are registered in `/sources_index.md`;
  placement is proposed in `/ROADMAP.md` before anything is merged.
- Markers for changed blocks: `% REORDERED`, `% REWRITTEN`, `% PROOF ADDED BY REWRITER`, `% AUTHOR-NOTE:`.
- `unsorted/legacy/` is read-only.
- After every change: `tools/build_all.ps1` (runs `tools/check_xrefs.py`), then `tools/check_integrity.py`.
